# =========================
# Project gallery images (temporary local placeholders)
# Each project's full image set lives in public/projects/<slug>/ for now,
# scraped from Behance ahead of the real CMS/Cloudflare-backed asset API.
# They're heavy (hundreds of MB) and disposable, so they stay untracked -
# every dev who needs them locally re-runs the import rather than everyone
# carrying them in git history forever. The single curated hero image per
# project (public/projects/image-<slug>.png) is unaffected and stays tracked.
# =========================
public/projects/*/